      "created": 1794641615665,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Design Facebook (News Feed System)",
      "fontSize": 32.6,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Design Facebook (News Feed System)",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "pfxYABHMfD0NGxCgx-s80",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 764.7723324461691,
      "y": 368.51210497589744,
      "width": 770,
      "height": 450,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dotted",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2H",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 737726109,
      "version": 796,
      "versionNonce": 388430820,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794665975961,
      "created": 1794641629371,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functional Requirements\n1) Create posts\n2) Follow / unfollow users\n3) View personalized + public/recommended feeds\n4) Infinite scroll with cursor pagination\n\nNon-functional Requirements\n1) 99.99% availability target\n2) Durable post writes; eventually consistent feeds\n3) p99 feed read <100ms (cache-hit target)\n4) p99 post creation <500ms (durable commit)\n5) Scale assumption: 100M daily active users\n\nCore Entities\n- Users, Posts, Follows\n- FeedEntries (recipient timelines)\n- OutboxEvents (reliable event publishing)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional Requirements\n1) Create posts\n2) Follow / unfollow users\n3) View personalized + public/recommended feeds\n4) Infinite scroll with cursor pagination\n\nNon-functional Requirements\n1) 99.99% availability target\n2) Durable post writes; eventually consistent feeds\n3) p99 feed read <100ms (cache-hit target)\n4) p99 post creation <500ms (durable commit)\n5) Scale assumption: 100M daily active users\n\nCore Entities\n- Users, Posts, Follows\n- FeedEntries (recipient timelines)\n- OutboxEvents (reliable event publishing)",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
