    {
      "id": "l7uYXXFqkDrSP3ribjkJn",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 312.78664676889287,
      "y": 2133.6196232024595,
      "width": 615.0196533203125,
      "height": 600,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b8s",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 560138212,
      "version": 811,
      "versionNonce": 1273372004,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794732948181,
      "created": 1794666158951,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functional Requirement:\n1) User should able to trade gold (buy/sell)\n2) User should able to see live gold price update\n3) User should able to see portfolio, assets\n4) System need a ledger for reconcile & accountability\n5) User should able to deposit & withdraw\n6) User should able show fees and confirmation before a trade\n7) Login and verification is needed.\n\nNon FR:\n1) Strong consistency\n2) 99.99% Availability\n3) Fail Close when network down\n4) <10ms real time update, <500ms init order\n5) locked quote 30s window\n6) security \n7) durability (no ack trade is lost)\n8) 1M DAU, 100k trade per day, 2-3 RPS, peak 40-50\nCore Entities:\n- Transactions\n- Wallet\n- Ledger\n- Payment\n- User",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional Requirement:\n1) User should able to trade gold (buy/sell)\n2) User should able to see live gold price update\n3) User should able to see portfolio, assets\n4) System need a ledger for reconcile & accountability\n5) User should able to deposit & withdraw\n6) User should able show fees and confirmation before a trade\n7) Login and verification is needed.\n\nNon FR:\n1) Strong consistency\n2) 99.99% Availability\n3) Fail Close when network down\n4) <10ms real time update, <500ms init order\n5) locked quote 30s window\n6) security \n7) durability (no ack trade is lost)\n8) 1M DAU, 100k trade per day, 2-3 RPS, peak 40-50\nCore Entities:\n- Transactions\n- Wallet\n- Ledger\n- Payment\n- User",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "U3h7eFx9PDOr9kOAQSAcr",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 467.73170936846304,
      "y": 2571.974706111356,
      "width": 8,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
